-- Deep-frozen.
--
--   arming               S2's draft arming sword (fixture F1's main chain), 6 points, 5.60 studs: E-S3.5's golden edge
--   longsword, dagger    straight double edges with a tapered tip
--   sabre                one curved edge (one side)
--   flamberge            wavy edges voxelized at 0.05 stud (123 points)
--   tilted               the arming sword with its grip axis turned 30°: it maps to arming's source
--   serrated, saw        teeth every 0.10 / 0.05 stud, 0.10 / 0.15 deep (the saw: 139 points, 22.3 studs)
--   zigzag               256 points ±0.30 stud across the blade (153 studs), the source bound's worst case; also
--                        Cost.X08_EDGE, T-PERF-02's trace generate case
--   order                the nine names in the prototype's order

